<title>USA: Zesiger Capital has 14.9 pct UltraFem stake.</title>
<headline>Zesiger Capital has 14.9 pct UltraFem stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zesiger Captial Group LLC said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing Monday it holds a 14.9 percent stake, or 942,259 common shares. in UltraFem Inc.</p>
<p>Zesiger disclosed its latest position on UltraFem in a 13G filing.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
